	)
	(text_box "Project Desctiption:\n\nThe Peer will help you when you most need guidance.\nIts a Coin-sized device that communicates with you over an OLED Display.\nWhen you feel the need for a decisive opinion, just flip it and it will show you the way.\n\nTechnical:\n\nThe core of this device is the STM32U0 Microprocessor, the LIS2DH Motion Sensor and W096016-XALW OLED Display.\nAll powered by a x2 AAA Battery.\n\nBoths the processor and motion sensor are ultra-low power devices, consuming as little as 0.3mA (worst-case).\n\nThe display will the source of power consumption, using up to 5mA when on. \nSmart porgramming and power management is required conserve the battery."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 176.53 12.7 0)
		(size 106.68 91.44)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width 0.254)
			(type solid)
		)
		(fill
